sequenceDiagram
  participant T as transaction thread (txc)
  participant K as KernelDevice
  participant Q as aio_queue_t (libaio/io_uring)
  participant A as _aio_thread
  participant BS as BlueStore
  T->>K: aio_write(off, bl, ioc)  (only recorded in ioc)
  T->>K: aio_submit(ioc)
  K->>Q: submit_batch(pending_aios) up to bdev_aio_max_queue_depth=1024
  Q-->>K: number submitted (EAGAIN → retry with delay)
  loop every bdev_aio_poll_ms=250ms or event
    A->>Q: get_next_completed(max=bdev_aio_reap_max=16)
    Q-->>A: completed aio_t[]
    A->>A: decrement ioc->num_running
  end
  A->>BS: aio_callback(priv=txc) when all of ioc's aios are done
  BS->>BS: _txc_state_proc: AIO_WAIT → IO_DONE → KV_QUEUED
